00:00:00.242 --> 00:00:02.759 position:58% line:76%
Hello and welcome to
"Two people about to make a mistake."

00:00:03.369 --> 00:00:05.061 line:71%
<c.yellow>Why, Tom? Why?</c>

00:00:05.061 --> 00:00:07.757 position:56% line:0%
Because a few weeks ago,
I was on Marques Brownlee's podcast.

00:00:07.757 --> 00:00:10.168 line:0%
We talked about doing this.
They had the sauces in the back.

00:00:10.168 --> 00:00:12.768 position:58% line:0%
And then we just went to lunch
and forgot about it, and I drove off.

00:00:12.768 --> 00:00:14.730 line:8%
<c.yellow>And you remembered,
but now I'm here.</c>

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:15.987 line:85%
Well, I asked a few people,

00:00:15.987 --> 00:00:17.956 line:91%
<i>(laughing)</i> and you were
the first person who said yes!

00:00:17.956 --> 00:00:20.181 line:91%
<c.yellow>I did say yes.
So this is my fault equally.</c>

00:00:20.181 --> 00:00:21.635 line:85%
Entirely, entirely(!)

00:00:22.216 --> 00:00:25.770 line:0%
So the producers have sent over
a stack of questions and answers.

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:28.754 position:61% line:0%
I've not seen these. You've not steamed
the envelopes open or anything.

00:00:28.754 --> 00:00:31.250 line:8%
<c.yellow>I haven't.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>No, these just arrived.</c>

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:34.732 line:91%
They're all estimation questions.
So they're all number answers.

00:00:34.732 --> 00:00:35.793 line:85%
<c.yellow>Oh...</c>

00:00:35.793 --> 00:00:38.261 line:91%
Furthest away in each round
tries that round's hot sauce.

00:00:38.261 --> 00:00:40.571 line:85%
We start easy.

00:00:40.571 --> 00:00:42.172 line:85%
We end up at this end.

00:00:42.172 --> 00:00:45.173 position:56% line:91%
And I really— The reason that we're
not just testing all the hot sauces:

00:00:45.173 --> 00:00:46.418 position:58% line:85%
First, lots of people have done that.

00:00:46.418 --> 00:00:48.442 line:91%
And second, I really don't
wanna do this one.

00:00:48.442 --> 00:00:49.470 line:85%
I really...

00:00:49.470 --> 00:00:51.381 size:72% position:36% line:91%
<c.yellow>So that one's worse
than this one?</c>

00:00:51.381 --> 00:00:52.990 line:85%
Every time I watch <i>Hot Ones,</i>

00:00:52.990 --> 00:00:55.270 line:91%
which by the way,
we don't have permission from them.

00:00:55.270 --> 00:00:57.153 line:91%
I hope you don't mind.
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(both laughing)</i></c>

00:00:57.153 --> 00:01:00.001 position:56% line:91%
