<c.yellow>I am screwed.</c>

00:01:14.909 --> 00:01:16.837 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(uproarious laughter)</i></c>

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:23.161 size:75% position:38% line:91%
