00:02:08.271 --> 00:02:09.837 line:91%
You know, it's—
<c.yellow>Yeah.</c>

00:02:09.837 --> 00:02:13.151 position:59% line:91%
No one's got a number in the hundreds.
No one's put 100,000 in there.

00:02:13.151 --> 00:02:14.587 line:85%
