00:02:15.087 --> 00:02:17.002 position:56% line:85%
If this is 10,000, we're in trouble.

00:02:17.002 --> 00:02:18.559 line:91%
<c.yellow>What happens then?</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>We both do it.</c>

00:02:18.559 --> 00:02:20.876 position:61% line:91%
<c.yellow>Oh okay, easy.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>I just made these rules up on the spot.</c>

00:02:23.090 --> 00:02:25.810 position:58% line:85%
<c.yellow>The answer is... <i>(sputtered laughter)</i></c>

00:02:25.810 --> 00:02:27.614 line:85%
<c.yellow>...55,000.</c>

00:02:29.025 --> 00:02:30.936 line:85%
