00:02:54.806 --> 00:02:56.820 line:91%
<c.yellow>I'll do that moving forward.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Yeah, yeah.</c>

00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:58.596 position:69% line:85%
<c.yellow>You know, it definitely registers, that one.</c>

00:02:58.596 --> 00:03:00.139 line:85%
Yeah? Alright.

00:03:00.139 --> 00:03:01.793 line:91%
<c.yellow>Which is very worrying.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>That's very worrying.</c>

00:03:01.793 --> 00:03:03.203 line:91%
Question two.
<c.yellow>Question two.</c>

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:08.063 position:58% line:0%
